{
 "file": "EmuquTests/HealthWorkoutReplacementTests.swift",
 "hash": "77889a059fe5ae70",
 "role": "XCTest suite for replacing and deleting a session's exported workouts in Apple Health against the in-memory Health store that keeps each workout with its samples: a re-export leaves one workout and its samples (earlier tail and identity-less copy deleted, workouts last), delete-forever leaves only other sessions' workouts, a failed sample delete still deletes the workout, only a locked read is skipped, a workout saved while locked has its earlier copies deleted on the next return (and a failed cleanup is kept), nothing is deleted without a versioned copy, the export stamp asks for no re-upload, and one HealthSampleWatch read per anchor at a time. The class is marked deprecated with HKWorkout's initialiser, the only way to make a workout fixture outside a real store.",
 "types": [
  "HealthWorkoutReplacementTests: class — @MainActor XCTestCase, @available deprecated 17.0 for its HKWorkout fixtures"
